===
title: Repair
---
<<checkpoint scene.repair>>
<<move left 0.25 0.5 1 1 0>>
<<hide cg 0>>
<<hide overlay 0>>
<<move right 0.75 0.5 1 1 0>>
<<voice none 0>>
<<effect none 0>>
<<background bg.night>>
<<show left actor.alice 500>>
<<show right actor.bob 500>>
<<music audio.music 500>>
<<ambience audio.ambience 500>>
<<set $story__attempts = $story__attempts + 1>>
Ivo: Hold these two wires together. I will tell you when to let go.
The receiver answers with a thin, uncertain tone.
<<effect audio.effect 250>>
Mara: It sounds like someone trying very hard to whistle.
Ivo: That is the clearest thing this room has said in years.
Mara: Tell them we are here. Tell them we kept the light.
<<set $story__signal = true>>
Ivo: Signal sent. Now we listen.
<<jump Dawn>>
===
title: Roof
---
<<checkpoint scene.roof>>
<<hide right 0>>
<<hide cg 0>>
<<hide overlay 0>>
<<move left 0.25 0.5 1 1 0>>
<<voice none 0>>
<<effect none 0>>
<<background bg.night>>
<<show left actor.alice 500>>
<<music audio.music 500>>
<<ambience audio.ambience 500>>
<<set $story__attempts = $story__attempts + 1>>
Mara: The stairs always seemed shorter when someone else carried the battery.
Ivo: I can still hear you complaining from downstairs. The antenna must be working.
<<move left 0.4 0.45 1.2 1 1000>>
Mara: There. The cable reaches if I stand right here.
<<effect audio.effect 250>>
For a moment, the rooftop is brighter than the sea.
<<set $story__signal = true>>
Mara: Signal sent. Come up before I decide to keep the view.
<<jump Dawn>>
===
title: Dawn
---
<<checkpoint scene.dawn>>
<<hide left 0>>
<<hide right 0>>
<<hide overlay 0>>
<<voice none 0>>
<<effect none 0>>
<<background bg.day>>
<<show cg cg.sun 1000>>
<<music audio.music 500>>
<<ambience none 500>>
<<if $story__route == "repair">>
Ivo: She says she heard the whistle. She is bringing a better radio.
<<else>>
Ivo: She saw the rooftop flash. She says you can stop waving now.
<<endif>>
Mara: I was not waving. I was keeping warm.
Beyond the window, the ferry turns toward the little harbor.
Mara: We should leave the light on.
The End — Last Signal
===
